863
00:54:08.110 --> 00:54:09.195
Aku perlu bertemu bosmu.

864
00:54:09.278 --> 00:54:10.571
Soal apa?

865
00:54:10.655 --> 00:54:11.906
Dia membunuh Justin.

866
00:54:11.989 --> 00:54:13.032
